{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576940/extras/addtowishlist_4v.gif?t=1745102174\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Molitva</strong> \u2013 a brutal, nonlinear visual novel about sins committed and the final chance for redemption.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Plot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During his suicide, when despair consumes his soul, Artemy prays for forgiveness. And God answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The heavenly gift \u2013 three days in the Borderland, a fragile world between sin and redemption. Here, the past comes to life, fears take shape, and every choice leads either to salvation or final oblivion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576940/extras/Description.png?t=1745102174\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When the past leaves you as nothing more than fertilizer for graveyard weeds, there remains only one question: Are you worthy of forgiveness?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3576940?t=1745102174","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576940/12b907d82d7b4acc7bda17410956497065d2946a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745102174","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576940/eaea0691332720353b324eab7677fa19c7b5220a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745102174","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576940/eaea0691332720353b324eab7677fa19c7b5220a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745102174","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game includes depictions of suicide and violence